<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Interactive Handout – The Legend of Suro & Boyo</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bangers&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 50%, #0f3460 100%);
    min-height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .dot-bg {
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 28px 28px;
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
  }
  .page { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 0 32px; }

  /* HEADER */
  .header-banner { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f7971e, #ffd200, #f7971e); padding: 0 0 6px; }
  .header-inner {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d1b69 0%, #11998e 100%);
    padding: 28px 32px 22px; text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .deco-l { position: absolute; left: 20px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font-size: 60px; opacity: 0.3; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px #11998e); }
  .deco-r { position: absolute; right: 20px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font-size: 60px; opacity: 0.3; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px #ffd200); }
  .header-badge {
    display: inline-block; background: #ffd200; color: #2d1b69;
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px;
    padding: 5px 20px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }
  .header-title {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 42px; letter-spacing: 3px; color: #fff;
    text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #f7971e, 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .header-sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }

  /* OBJECTIVES */
  .obj-section {
    margin: 24px 16px 0;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,210,0,0.4);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px 22px; position: relative;
  }
  .obj-label {
    position: absolute; top: -15px; left: 20px;
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1px;
    background: #ffd200; color: #2d1b69;
    padding: 3px 16px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }
  .obj-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .obj-item {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px;
  }
  .obj-icon { font-size: 24px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
  .obj-text { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; }

  /* STEPS LABEL */
  .steps-label {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: #ffd200; text-align: center; margin: 26px 0 14px;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }

  /* COMIC STRIP */
  .comic-strip { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; margin: 0 12px 16px; }
  .comic-panel {
    display: flex; overflow: hidden; position: relative;
    border: 3px solid #222; margin-bottom: -3px;
  }
  .comic-panel:first-child { border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; }
  .comic-panel:last-child  { border-radius: 0 0 16px 16px; margin-bottom: 0; }

  .panel-number {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    min-width: 64px; font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 32px; color: #fff;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4); padding: 10px 6px;
  }
  .panel-step-word { font-family:'Bangers',cursive; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; opacity:.8; margin-top:-4px; }

  .panel-illus {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 96px; min-height: 96px; flex-shrink: 0; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .illus-emoji {
    font-size: 46px; filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.4));
    animation: floaty 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes floaty { 0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(-3deg);} 50%{transform:translateY(-6px) rotate(3deg);} }

  .panel-content {
    flex:1; padding: 16px 16px 16px 12px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  }
  .panel-title { font-family:'Bangers',cursive; font-size:18px; letter-spacing:1px; margin:0 0 5px; color:#fff; text-shadow:1px 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
  .panel-time {
    display:inline-block; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;
    padding:2px 10px; border-radius:8px;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.25); color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    margin-bottom:8px; width:fit-content;
  }
  .panel-desc { color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88); font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 8px 0; }

  .speech-bubble {
    position:relative; background:#fff; border-radius:10px;
    padding:9px 14px; margin-top:5px; margin-bottom: 12px;
    border:2px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); box-shadow:2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }
  .speech-bubble::before { content:''; position:absolute; top:-10px; left:18px; border:6px solid transparent; border-bottom-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.12); }
  .speech-bubble::after  { content:''; position:absolute; top:-7px;  left:19px; border:5px solid transparent; border-bottom-color:#fff; }
  .speech-text { font-size:13px; font-weight:700; font-style:italic; color:#222; margin:0; }

  .action-chips { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-top:9px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .chip {
    font-size:12px; font-weight:700; padding:4px 11px; border-radius:12px;
    color:#fff; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }

  /* INTERACTIVE ELEMENTS */
  .student-input {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 80px;
    padding: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    border: 2px solid #222;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #222;
    resize: vertical;
    margin-top: 6px;
    box-shadow: inset 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  .student-input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #ffd200;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 210, 0, 0.6);
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  .input-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffd200;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    display: block;
  }

  /* SAVE STATUS INDICATOR */
  .save-status {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    padding: 4px 0 0;
    min-height: 18px;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }
  .save-status.visible { color: #ffd200; }

  /* WARM-UP STATUE IMAGE */
  .statue-img-wrap {
    margin: 4px 0 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 2px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  }
  .statue-img-wrap img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .statue-img-caption {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 5px 0 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* THEN vs NOW COMPARISON */
  .compare-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 4px 0 4px;
  }
  .compare-col { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .compare-col-label {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive;
    font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-align: center; color: #2d1b69;
    background: #ffd200;
    border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
    padding: 3px 0;
    border: 2px solid #222;
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .compare-col .statue-img-wrap {
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
    border-top: none;
  }
  .compare-vs {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #ffd200;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 0 2px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .compare-wrap { flex-direction: column; }
    .compare-vs { padding: 2px 0; }
  }

  /* AI TOOL OPTIONS */
  .ai-tool-options {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 10px 0 12px;
  }
  .ai-tool-chip {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.22);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 6px 12px;
    text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.12s ease;
  }
  .ai-tool-chip:hover {
    background: rgba(255,210,0,0.28);
    border-color: #ffd200;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .ai-tool-chip:active { transform: translateY(0); }
  .ai-tool-chip .ai-emoji { font-size: 16px; }
  .ai-tool-note {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 11px; font-style: italic;
    margin: -4px 0 10px;
  }

  /* PANEL COLORS */
  .p1 .panel-number { background:#e53935; }
  .p1 .panel-illus  { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffcdd2,#ef9a9a); }
  .p2 .panel-number { background:#7b1fa2; }
  .p2 .panel-illus  { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e1bee7,#ce93d8); }
  .p3 .panel-number { background:#1565c0; }
  .p3 .panel-illus  { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#bbdefb,#90caf9); }
  .p4 .panel-number { background:#2e7d32; }
  .p4 .panel-illus  { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c8e6c9,#a5d6a7); }
  .p5 .panel-number { background:#e65100; }
  .p5 .panel-illus  { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe0b2,#ffcc80); }
  .p6 .panel-number { background:#00838f; }
  .p6 .panel-illus  { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b2ebf2,#80deea); }

  /* WRAP-UP */
  .wrapup-box {
    margin:8px 12px 16px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f7971e 0%,#ffd200 100%);
    border-radius:16px; padding:18px 22px;
    border:3px solid #222; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .wrapup-box::before { content:'🏆'; position:absolute; right:18px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); font-size:58px; opacity:0.22; }
  .wrapup-title { font-family:'Bangers',cursive; font-size:22px; letter-spacing:2px; color:#2d1b69; text-shadow:1px 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4); margin:0 0 8px; }
  .wrapup-text  { color:#2d1b69; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.65; }

  /* FINAL SUBMISSION LINK/QR BOX */
  .submit-box {
    margin: 8px 12px 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #11998e 0%, #2d1b69 100%);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px 22px;
    border: 3px solid #222;
  }
  .submit-box-title {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #ffd200; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 6px;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  .submit-box-text {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size: 13.5px; text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .submit-flex {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .submit-qr-wrap { text-align: center; }
  .submit-qr-wrap img {
    width: 140px; height: 140px; border-radius: 10px;
    border: 3px solid #fff; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    display: block; background: #fff; padding: 4px;
  }
  .submit-qr-caption {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .submit-link-col { text-align: center; }
  .btn-submit-link {
    display: inline-block; text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 1px;
    background: #ffd200; color: #2d1b69;
    border: 2.5px solid #222; padding: 12px 28px;
    border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #222;
    transition: all 0.1s ease;
  }
  .btn-submit-link:hover { transform: translate(-1px,-1px); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #222; }
  .btn-submit-link:active { transform: translate(2px,2px); box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #222; }
  .submit-link-text {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .submit-link-text a { color: #ffd200; }

  /* SUBMIT ACTION */
  .action-container {
    padding: 0 12px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .btn-submit {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive;
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    background: #11998e;
    color: #fff;
    border: 3px solid #222;
    padding: 12px 32px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #222;
    transition: all 0.1s ease;
  }
  .btn-submit:hover {
    background: #14b8a6;
    transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #222;
  }
  .btn-submit:active {
    transform: translate(2px, 2px);
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #222;
  }

  .footer-note { text-align:center; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35); font-size:12px; padding:15px 0 0; }

  /* NARRATIVE TEXT HELPER BUTTON */
  .helper-btn-wrap { margin: 4px 0 14px; text-align: center; }
  .btn-helper {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive;
    font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd200, #f7971e);
    color: #2d1b69;
    border: 2.5px solid #222;
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #222;
    transition: all 0.1s ease;
  }
  .btn-helper:hover { transform: translate(-1px,-1px); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #222; }
  .btn-helper:active { transform: translate(2px,2px); box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #222; }

  /* NARRATIVE TEXT MODAL */
  .modal-overlay {
    display: none;
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(10,10,25,0.75);
    z-index: 100;
    padding: 24px 14px;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
  .modal-overlay.open { display: block; }
  .modal-box {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
    border: 3px solid #ffd200;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 22px 22px 26px;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .modal-close {
    position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 14px;
    background: #e53935; color: #fff;
    border: 2px solid #222; border-radius: 50%;
    width: 30px; height: 30px;
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer; line-height: 1;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }
  .modal-title {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #ffd200; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 4px;
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .modal-sub {
    text-align: center; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .modal-section { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .modal-section-title {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: #fff; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    display: inline-block; padding: 3px 12px; border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px; border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,210,0,0.4);
  }
  .modal-text { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .modal-list { margin: 0 0 6px 18px; padding: 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88); font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .modal-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 6px 0 10px; }
  .modal-table th, .modal-table td {
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    padding: 6px 8px; font-size: 12.5px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    text-align: left; vertical-align: top;
  }
  .modal-table th {
    background: rgba(255,210,0,0.25); color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 13px;
  }
  .modal-example {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); border-left: 3px solid #ffd200;
    border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 10px; margin: 4px 0 8px;
    font-size: 12.5px; font-style: italic; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  }

  /* WORKED EXAMPLE STORY CARD */
  .story-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 14px 10px;
  }
  .story-card-title {
    font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: #fff; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .story-part { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .story-tag {
    display: inline-block; font-family: 'Bangers', cursive; font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: #fff; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .story-tag.orientation { background: #e53935; }
  .story-tag.complication { background: #7b1fa2; }
  .story-tag.resolution { background: #1565c0; }
  .story-tag.coda { background: #2e7d32; }
  .story-part p {
    margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
  }
  .story-moral {
    margin-top: 2px; font-size: 13px; color: #ffd200; font-weight: 800;
  }

  @media print {
    body { background: #fff; color: #000; padding: 0; }
    .dot-bg, .btn-submit, .action-container, .save-status, .helper-btn-wrap, .modal-overlay { display: none !important; }
    .page { max-width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .comic-panel { break-inside: avoid; border-color: #000; }
    .student-input { 
      background: #fff; 
      border: 1px solid #000; 
      color: #000;
      box-shadow: none;
    }
    .panel-title, .steps-label, .header-title { text-shadow: none !important; color: #000 !important; }
    .panel-time, .chip, .header-badge, .obj-label { background: #eee !important; color: #000 !important; border: 1px solid #000 !important; }
    .header-inner { background: #fff !important; color: #000 !important; border-bottom: 3px solid #000; }
    .obj-section { background: #fff !important; border: 2px solid #000 !important; }
    .obj-text { color: #000 !important; }
    .wrapup-box { background: #eee !important; border: 2px solid #000 !important; color: #000 !important; }
    .wrapup-title, .wrapup-text { color: #000 !important; text-shadow: none !important; }
    .statue-img-caption { color: #333 !important; }
    .ai-tool-chip { background: #eee !important; color: #000 !important; border: 1px solid #000 !important; }
    .ai-tool-note { display: none !important; }
    .submit-box { background: #eee !important; border: 2px solid #000 !important; }
    .submit-box-title, .submit-box-text, .submit-link-text, .submit-qr-caption { color: #000 !important; text-shadow: none !important; }
    .btn-submit-link { background: #fff !important; color: #000 !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="dot-bg"></div>

<div class="modal-overlay" id="narrative-modal">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <button type="button" class="modal-close" onclick="document.getElementById('narrative-modal').classList.remove('open')">✕</button>
    <div class="modal-title">📖 Mastering Narrative Text</div>
    <div class="modal-sub">A quick refresher before you start writing!</div>

    <div class="modal-section">
      <div class="modal-section-title">1️⃣ Social Function</div>
      <p class="modal-text">The main purpose of a narrative text is to <strong>entertain</strong> or <strong>amuse</strong> the readers with a story. However, it often carries a deeper purpose: to teach a moral lesson, share a cultural value, or provide reflection on human life.</p>
      <p class="modal-text">Common types of narrative texts include:</p>
      <ul class="modal-list">
        <li>Fairytales (e.g., <em>Cinderella</em>)</li>
        <li>Folktales / Legends (e.g., <em>The Legend of Malin Kundang</em>)</li>
        <li>Fables (e.g., <em>The Tortoise and the Hare</em>)</li>
        <li>Short Stories / Fiction</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="modal-section">
      <div class="modal-section-title">2️⃣ Generic Structure</div>
      <p class="modal-text">A good narrative text always follows a specific structure so the story flows logically. It typically consists of four main parts:</p>
      <table class="modal-table">
        <tr><th>Part</th><th>Name</th><th>What happens?</th></tr>
        <tr><td>1</td><td>Orientation</td><td>The Introduction — introduces the characters, setting (where), and time (when).</td></tr>
        <tr><td>2</td><td>Complication</td><td>The Problem — the main character faces a crisis that disrupts their normal life. This is the climax of the story.</td></tr>
        <tr><td>3</td><td>Resolution</td><td>The Solution — the problem is resolved, either happily (happy ending) or tragically (sad ending).</td></tr>
        <tr><td>4</td><td>Coda / Re-orientation</td><td>The Lesson — the moral of the story or the final state of the characters (this part is optional).</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="modal-section">
      <div class="modal-section-title">3️⃣ Example: Putting It All Together</div>
      <p class="modal-text">Here's a short narrative text with each structure part labeled, so you can see how they fit together:</p>
      <div class="story-card">
        <div class="story-card-title">🐺 The Boy Who Cried Wolf</div>

        <div class="story-part">
          <span class="story-tag orientation">Orientation</span>
          <p>Once upon a time, there was a young shepherd boy who watched over his sheep near a dark forest. He felt very bored all day, so he thought of a plan to amuse himself.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="story-part">
          <span class="story-tag complication">Complication</span>
          <p>One afternoon, he ran toward the village and shouted, "Wolf! Wolf! The wolf is chasing the sheep!" The kind villagers dropped their work and ran up the hill to help him. However, when they arrived, they found no wolf. The boy just laughed at them. The next day, he did it again. The villagers ran up the hill again, only to be laughed at a second time. Then, a few days later, a real wolf came out from the forest and began to attack the sheep. Terrified, the boy screamed, "Please help me! There is a real wolf this time!"</p>
        </div>

        <div class="story-part">
          <span class="story-tag resolution">Resolution</span>
          <p>But this time, the villagers thought he was lying again. Nobody came to help him. The wolf destroyed the entire flock of sheep, and the boy was left weeping.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="story-part" style="margin-bottom:0;">
          <span class="story-tag coda">Coda / Moral Lesson</span>
          <p class="story-moral">The Moral: Nobody believes a liar, even when they are telling the truth.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="modal-section">
      <div class="modal-section-title">4️⃣ Language Features</div>
      <p class="modal-text">To write or analyze a narrative text effectively, pay attention to these linguistic characteristics:</p>
      <ul class="modal-list">
        <li><strong>Past Tenses</strong> — since the events happened in the past, use Simple Past, Past Continuous, or Past Perfect.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="modal-example">"Once upon a time, a beautiful princess lived in a castle. She was walking in the garden when she found a golden ring."</div>
      <ul class="modal-list">
        <li><strong>Time Connectives / Conjunctions</strong> — words that show the sequence of events.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="modal-example">First, then, suddenly, after that, finally, meanwhile.</div>
      <ul class="modal-list">
        <li><strong>Action Verbs</strong> — verbs that show physical action.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="modal-example">Ran, killed, climbed, dug, brought.</div>
      <ul class="modal-list">
        <li><strong>Saying and Thinking Verbs</strong> — verbs that express what characters said or thought.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="modal-example">Said, told, thought, wondered, felt.</div>
      <ul class="modal-list">
        <li><strong>Direct Speech</strong> — using dialogues to make the story alive.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="modal-example">"Don't go into the woods," whispered the old man.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

